  "question": {
    "text": "An ideal gas undergoes a four step cycle as shown in the&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>V</mi></math>&nbsp;diagram below. During this cycle, heat is absorbed by the gas in:\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/4d18554e-7e8e-4c08-957f-347a7804e825-image.png\" style=\"width: 280px; height: 190px;\" />",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "O8a6s",
      "text": "steps&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "Eczvh",
      "text": "steps&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "G16Ud",
      "text": "steps&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "9CApH",
      "text": "steps&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>In Step <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math>:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo></math>constant</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo></math>&nbsp;increasing</p><p>So,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi></math>&nbsp;also will be increase (From equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math>)</p><p>Now,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>T</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8593;</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo></math>&nbsp;Positive</p><p>So,</p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo></math>absorbed</p><p>Now In step <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math>,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8593;</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo></math>&nbsp;constant</p><p>So from equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math>,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi></math>&nbsp;will also be increasing.</p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>v</mi></msub><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>T</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>&#8593;</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo></math>Positive</p><p>So,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo></math>absorbed</p><p>correct option is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced></math>.</p>",
